# Committed on purpose: build-time flags only — NEVER put secrets here
# (secrets go in .env.local / EAS secrets, see the repo's .env.example).
#
# L-C1: Expo SDK 57's winter runtime (expo/src/winter/runtime.native.ts:41-53)
# replaces globalThis.fetch with expo/fetch unless this flag is set. expo/fetch
# rejects React Native's {uri, name, type} FormData parts
# (expo/src/winter/fetch/convertFormData.ts:77 "Unsupported FormDataPart
# implementation") before any request leaves the device, so every photo and
# document upload failed. Keep React Native's own fetch, which streams those parts.
# Mirrored in eas.json build profiles; guarded by src/__tests__/rn-fetch-flag.test.ts.
EXPO_PUBLIC_USE_RN_FETCH=1
